  "notes": [
    "**The riff is the whole gig:** a two-bar ostinato in 8ths under the F#m/G#m alternation; same shape from B under Bm7. Play it like a metronome — no fills until the pre-chorus.",
    "**Pre-chorus opens up:** D and F#m one bar each, held roots; C#7 sets up the chorus.",
    "**Bar counts are the weak spot here:** the vamp is one 2-bar cell repeated, so count phrases against the vocal, not the chords."
  ],
